## Reproduce Evaluation

conda create --name rwun --yes python=3.10
conda activate rwun
cd Reqomp-master
pip install .

### Organization

The RwUn implementation is made up of the files in the folder [RwUn](/RwUn/).

All examples presented in the submitted paper can be found in [RwUn/examples](RwUn/examples).

### Paper Claims

To get the result of Table 2, run:
```
python run_evaluation.py 0
```
This may require minutes and will write two files of results to evaluation folder: dependency_result and table1_result.

To get the result of Fig 11, run and wait for minutes:
```
python run_evaluation.py 1
```
This may require minutes and will store randomly generated circuit, evaluation results on these circuits and *.pdf corresponds to the result.

To get the result of Fig 10, run:
```
python run_evaluation.py 2
```
This may require hours and the result is similar with above.
